   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<hr/>\n<h2>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#sunday-september-26-2021-1\" name=\"sunday-september-26-2021-1\"></a><strong>Sunday, September 26, 2021</strong>\n</h2>\n<p>Hello <img alt=\":wave:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wave.png?v=10\" title=\":wave:\"/>! Here are the Working Group updates from the last week. If you feel like you’re missing out, check out the <a href=\"https://www.notion.so/Calendar-be8a6868a6ef4305b7521fa35a2eb9ba\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">calendar</a> and join us in real time during any of our many calls.</p>\n<p>Spotlight: <a href=\"https://dada.art/home\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">DADA</a> / <a href=\"https://powerdada.medium.com/the-invisible-economy-incentive-framework-1c414ed5c5b7\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Invisible Economy</a></p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#comms-2\" name=\"comms-2\"></a><img alt=\":satellite:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/satellite.png?v=10\" title=\":satellite:\"/> Comms</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Economics Design podcast <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=svddY_OUrvw&amp;t=1s\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">featured</a> Griff talking about participatory economics and public goods in DAOs</li>\n<li>Currently working on a video campaign for Twitter</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#commons-swarm-3\" name=\"commons-swarm-3\"></a><img alt=\":globe_with_meridians:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/globe_with_meridians.png?v=10\" title=\":globe_with_meridians:\"/> Commons Swarm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://Gardens-xdai.1hive.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Gardens-xdai.1hive.org</a> is LIVE!</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsSwarm/evmscripter\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">EVM-Crispr</a> library is at V1.0 and improving</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum Highlight</strong>: <a href=\"https://gardens-xdai.1hive.org/#/garden/0x1e2d5fb385e2eae45bd42357e426507a63597397\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Check out BrightID’s Garden!</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#homes-communitas-4\" name=\"homes-communitas-4\"></a><img alt=\":homes:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/homes.png?v=10\" title=\":homes:\"/> Communitas</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://file.coffee/u/J5ZdAky_0djEKL.mp4\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Updates on orientation bot</a> by Vyvy-vi</li>\n<li>Ongoing collaboration with Comms on an orientation video and an orientation dashboard, the latter being led by Nic</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum Highlight</strong>: Please send Mount Manu a Discord message if you have any feedback on how to improve our orientation process</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#gravity-5\" name=\"gravity-5\"></a><img alt=\":dove:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/dove.png?v=10\" title=\":dove:\"/> Gravity</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Successful kickoff of our 2nd Graviton Training!</li>\n<li>58 people attended the first session, which dealth with Contextualization and Unified Thinking, and was hosted by Durgadas. Our next session will be this coming Tuesday 28th at 20:00 CET / 14:00 ET on our Discord’s Gravity Voice Channel</li>\n<li>We will now be using <a href=\"https://app.zenhub.com/workspaces/gravity-614b594733915b001237f06e/board?repos=409276305\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">ZenHub</a> to manage the Gravity registry</li>\n<li>Follow us on Twitter <a href=\"https://twitter.com/GravityDAO\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">@GravityDAO</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum Highlight</strong>: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1txyn1dND8xG_ofNG_rxRzvNuBfGl3j20w9Au5N8kq0E/edit\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">2nd Graviton Training Study Plan</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#labs-6\" name=\"labs-6\"></a><img alt=\":microscope:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/microscope.png?v=10\" title=\":microscope:\"/> Labs</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/reward-system-moving-forward/570\">Rewards Research Group and Rewards Taskforce</a></li>\n<li>Ongoing Research on <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/coordinape-an-overview/616\">Coordinape</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum Highlight</strong>: Tokenspice Development Workshop Mondays 8 am PST/ 5 pm CEST</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#legal-7\" name=\"legal-7\"></a><img alt=\":classical_building:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/classical_building.png?v=10\" title=\":classical_building:\"/> Legal</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>There is a new draft of <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YmbGQhGspIlxhFzmzc1saWG0wzPLwz42lOF2E5NDXXk/edit\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Terms and Conditions for the ABC</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#0mega-8\" name=\"0mega-8\"></a><img alt=\":dizzy:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/dizzy.png?v=10\" title=\":dizzy:\"/> 0mega</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Currently working on defining the ethos of TE</li>\n<li>We analyzed the <a href=\"https://www.notion.so/Links-cade62a155ee475da580064553147bce#052982e5f7d846f1b747a851508aa3be\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">feedback</a> gathered during our <a href=\"https://https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ngUBguUdAITrNnVsum7UhjoMFUqcoFSVAj1R_yQwB2Q/edit#heading=h.scaxl8xu0r9z\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">first focus group on TE Ethics</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#params-9\" name=\"params-9\"></a><img alt=\":robot:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/robot.png?v=10\" title=\":robot:\"/> Params</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://commons-dashboard.netlify.app/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Commons Configuration Dashboard demo is ready!</a></li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum Highlight</strong>: If you have any issues with the demo, let us know <a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/commons-config-frontend/issues\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#soft-gov-10\" name=\"soft-gov-10\"></a><img alt=\":raised_hands:t4:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/raised_hands/4.png?v=10\" title=\":raised_hands:t4:\"/> Soft Gov</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Crafted a <a href=\"https://miro.com/app/board/o9J_lYcRTik=/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Miro board</a> of ideas to address cultural concerns</li>\n<li>Progress on our Reward System! Notes <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VGOHRiX6fg55zgCE361ja86UIPVZzl3ldcNOJGlbTsQ/edit#heading=h.fugkukz2582o\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>\n</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"https://https://snapshot.org/#/tecommons.eth\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">75% Governance giveback vote</a> is live on Snapshot!</li>\n<li>Change of addresses proposal will be live on Tuesday in the Hatch DAO</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#stewards-11\" name=\"stewards-11\"></a><img alt=\":ear_of_rice:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/ear_of_rice.png?v=10\" title=\":ear_of_rice:\"/> Stewards</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We have a new Steward! Welcome, Mitch</li>\n<li>TEC Timeline and WG Milestones big reveal <a href=\"https://https://miro.com/app/board/o9J_lbkGJHQ=/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here!</a>\n</li>\n<li>Our biweekly Stewards Council meeting revolved mainly around WG funding models <em>but</em> other topics were discussed as well: read all about it <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T1XxYQPHyAN6biQSlThLLeFO7Ihb8hidjJKd5MeKb7Y/edit\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#transparency-12\" name=\"transparency-12\"></a><img alt=\":male_detective:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/male_detective.png?v=10\" title=\":male_detective:\"/> Transparency</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Working on listing our token on CoinGecko</li>\n<li>Researching best practices for DAO treasury MGMT; forum post about it coming soon!</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\":books:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/books.png?v=10\" title=\":books:\"/> Thanks for reading the update this week! Be sure to check out the <a href=\"https://https://www.notion.so/Calendar-be8a6868a6ef4305b7521fa35a2eb9ba\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">calendar</a> to join us on a call! <img alt=\":phone:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/phone.png?v=10\" title=\":phone:\"/></p>",
